# Deploy tree policy:
# safe to commit: deploy/caddy, deploy/windows, deploy/grafana,
# deploy/prometheus, deploy/pgbouncer, and sanitized deploy/retained material.
# keep checkout-local records, secrets, and generated deploy output off GitHub.
